---
/* ============================================================
   EndMark — the small square that closes a feature.

     Which makes me wonder what else is on that list. <EndMark />

   Place it inline at the end of the last paragraph. Purely
   typographic, so it is hidden from assistive tech.
   ============================================================ */
---

<span class="endmark" aria-hidden="true"></span>

<style>
  .endmark {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    background: var(--accent);
    margin-left: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
